Feature: Pause
  P stops the flight. Press P again to continue from the point where it stopped. During the
  pause, the HUD says PAUSED (P). The views, the help and the other keys continue to work.

  Expectation: P pauses the sim
    Given the sim is running
    When the pilot toggles pause
    Then the sim is paused

  Expectation: P again resumes
    Given the sim is paused
    When the pilot toggles pause
    Then the sim is running

  Expectation: A pause holds the plane in your hand
    The throttle cannot throw the plane while time is stopped. Nothing happens: the plane
    stays in your hand, and the HUD still says PAUSED (P).
    Overrides: Throttle up throws the plane
    Overrides: A throw with the nose down crashes the plane
    Given the plane is in hand
    And the sim is paused
    When the throttle is above 55 %
    Then the plane is in hand

  Expectation: A throw during a pause waits for the pause to end
    Space starts the throw, but nothing moves until you press P again. Then the plane leaves
    your hand.
    Given the plane is in hand
    And the sim is paused
    When the pilot throws the plane
    Then the plane is launching
